Flask-Migrate single-database migration directory.

Create or upgrade a database:

    AUTO_CREATE_TABLES=false flask --app run.py db upgrade

After changing SQLAlchemy models:

    AUTO_CREATE_TABLES=false flask --app run.py db migrate -m "describe change"
    AUTO_CREATE_TABLES=false flask --app run.py db upgrade

Always review generated revisions before applying them. Existing unversioned
databases must only be stamped after their schema has been checked against the
current migration head.
